    "body": "Live test disproved the replacement hook. Right-stick input sometimes changed zoom and sometimes moved sideways or forward/back, so the patched field is a state-dependent world-map input field, not stable camera yaw. Modern Controls is disabled again. The next implementation will hook the game's final regular camera-rotation consumer and must leave movement and zoom unchanged.",
